%[text] **3. Root Locus, Steady State Error, Time Response and Controller Design** (20 marks)
%[text] Consider the control system:
%[text] ![](text:image:3616)
%[text] in the case when:
%[text] $D(s)=K\\;\\mbox{ and }\\; G(s)=\\frac{1}{s(s+2)(s+4)(s+6)}$
%[text] a) (5 marks) Sketch the root locus for the control system using matlab. 
% Your code goes here
clear
s = tf('s');

% Plant G(s)
G = 1 / (s*(s+2)*(s+4)*(s+6));

% Controller D(s) = K (gain only)
