%[text] **4. State Space Control** (20 marks)
%[text] Assume that the plant is given by:
%[text] $G(s) = \\frac{(s+4)(s-4)}{s(s+1)(s+2)(s+5)} = \\frac{(s^2-16)}{s^4+8s^3+17s^2+10s}$
%[text] a) (5 marks) Given G(s) what is the controller canonical (phase variable) state space representation of the plant G(s)?
clear
% Your code goes here
